    {
      "id": 13,
      "element_type": "Paragraph",
      "raw_text": "1.设n是描述问题规模的非负整数 ，下面的程序片段的时间复杂度是 （）。A",
      "formatting": {
        "element-type": "pdf-text",
        "font-size": "12pt",
        "font-family": "Arial",
        "font-weight": "normal"
      },
      "xml_path": "page_3_para_3.txt",
      "offset": 2381467843952
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "element_type": "Paragraph",
      "raw_text": "x=2;",
      "formatting": {
        "element-type": "pdf-text",
        "font-size": "12pt",
        "font-family": "Arial",
        "font-weight": "normal"
      },
      "xml_path": "page_3_para_4.txt",
      "offset": 2381482905456
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "element_type": "Paragraph",
      "raw_text": "while(x<n/ 2)",
      "formatting": {
        "element-type": "pdf-text",
        "font-size": "12pt",
        "font-family": "Arial",
        "font-weight": "normal"
      },
      "xml_path": "page_3_para_5.txt",
      "offset": 2381482913456
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "element_type": "Paragraph",
      "raw_text": "x=2*x;",
      "formatting": {
        "element-type": "pdf-text",
        "font-size": "12pt",
        "font-family": "Arial",
        "font-weight": "normal"
      },
      "xml_path": "page_3_para_6.txt",
      "offset": 2381482914800
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "element_type": "Paragraph",
      "raw_text": "A.O(log2n) B.O(n) C.O(nlog2n) D.O(n2)",
      "formatting": {
        "element-type": "pdf-text",
        "font-size": "12pt",
        "font-family": "Arial",
        "font-weight": "normal"
      },
      "xml_path": "page_3_para_7.txt",
      "offset": 2381479963376
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "element_type": "Paragraph",
      "raw_text": "2.设n是描述问题规模的非负整数 ，下面的程序片段的时间复杂度是 （）。B",
      "formatting": {
        "element-type": "pdf-text",
        "font-size": "12pt",
        "font-family": "Arial",
        "font-weight": "normal"
      },
      "xml_path": "page_3_para_8.txt",
      "offset": 2381467592272
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "element_type": "Paragraph",
      "raw_text": "x=0;",
      "formatting": {
        "element-type": "pdf-text",
        "font-size": "12pt",
        "font-family": "Arial",
        "font-weight": "normal"
      },
      "xml_path": "page_3_para_9.txt",
      "offset": 2381482915248
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "element_type": "Paragraph",
      "raw_text": "for(n>=(x+ 1)*(x+ 1))",
      "formatting": {
        "element-type": "pdf-text",
        "font-size": "12pt",
        "font-family": "Arial",
        "font-weight": "normal"
      },
      "xml_path": "page_3_para_10.txt",
      "offset": 2381487361760
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "element_type": "Paragraph",
      "raw_text": "x=x+ 1;",
      "formatting": {
        "element-type": "pdf-text",
        "font-size": "12pt",
        "font-family": "Arial",
        "font-weight": "normal"
      },
      "xml_path": "page_3_para_11.txt",
      "offset": 2381482915632
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "element_type": "Paragraph",
      "raw_text": "A.O(log2n) B.O(n1/2) C.O(n) D.O(n2)",
      "formatting": {
        "element-type": "pdf-text",
        "font-size": "12pt",
        "font-family": "Arial",
        "font-weight": "normal"
      },
      "xml_path": "page_3_para_12.txt",
      "offset": 2381479963472
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
