    {
      "id": 29,
      "element_type": "Paragraph",
      "raw_text": "【练习题】若希望循环队列中的元素都能得到利用，则需设置一个标志域 tag，并以 tag的值",
      "formatting": {
        "element-type": "pdf-text",
        "font-size": "12pt",
        "font-family": "Arial",
        "font-weight": "normal"
      },
      "xml_path": "page_4_para_6.txt",
      "offset": 2381467686448
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "element_type": "Paragraph",
      "raw_text": "为0或1来区分队首指针 front和队尾指针 rear相同时的队列状态是“空”还是“满”。试编写",
      "formatting": {
        "element-type": "pdf-text",
        "font-size": "12pt",
        "font-family": "Arial",
        "font-weight": "normal"
      },
      "xml_path": "page_4_para_7.txt",
      "offset": 2381467686272
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "element_type": "Paragraph",
      "raw_text": "与此结果相应得入队和出队算法。【练习题】在一个单向列表中，其节点结构为，其中 succ是指向其直接后继节点的指针。",
      "formatting": {
        "element-type": "pdf-text",
        "font-size": "12pt",
        "font-family": "Arial",
        "font-weight": "normal"
      },
      "xml_path": "page_4_para_8.txt",
      "offset": 2381467478000
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "element_type": "Paragraph",
      "raw_text": "已知 q所指节点是 p所指节点的前驱节点，若在 q和p之间插入节点 s，则执行 (       )。",
      "formatting": {
        "element-type": "pdf-text",
        "font-size": "12pt",
        "font-family": "Arial",
        "font-weight": "normal"
      },
      "xml_path": "page_4_para_9.txt",
      "offset": 2381467686624
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "element_type": "Paragraph",
      "raw_text": "A. s→succ =p→succ ; p→succ =s;                                      B. p→succ =s→succ ; s→succ =p;",
      "formatting": {
        "element-type": "pdf-text",
        "font-size": "12pt",
        "font-family": "Arial",
        "font-weight": "normal"
